<title>LUXEMBOURG: French minister sees no reason for doubt on EMU.</title>
<headline>French minister sees no reason for doubt on EMU.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn said on Sunday he could not see how anyone could have doubted France's commitment to launching a single currency in January 1999.</p>
<p>He had been asked during a meeting of EU finance ministers whether France's new Socialist-led government would respect the date and Maastricht treaty criteria for launching a single currency.</p>
<p>&quot;I do not see why anyone would have doubted it,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
</text>
